  "description": "The Backroad GRX RX810 Di2 1x11 is perfect for an adrenaline rush on challenging gravel rides. Equipped with the gravel-optimised SHIMANO GRX RX810 Di2 as well as a singlespeed drivetrain, versatile and solidly built ROSE G THIRTY gravel wheels wrapped in WTB gravel tyres and with a gravel handlebar suitable for off-road use, this bike has everything you need to master difficult trails. This gravel bike is ideal for off-road tours that require a wide range of gears. More long distance – Endurance Flex is fun – massive comfort in the saddle and a gravity-specific frame fork geometry offers perfect handling on road, gravel and technical terrain. Only a dry throat can stop you. More off-road – Action The frame and fork now allow for a tyre width of up to 45 mm with 700c and up to 47 mm with 650b wheels. For rougher road conditions, perfectly adapted protectors at the down tube and chainstays shield from stone chips. More experience – Adventure Moreover, the BACKROAD has several mounting points for bottle cages, AnythingCages or bags for the ultimate versatility. * approx. 8.6 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for deepest purple frame, size 57 cm, without pedals *Slight colour and paint deviations possible on frame and fork set",
